    "created_at": "2019-03-15T17:21:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-15T17:21:58Z",
    "body": "So, following the last link for the Chrome bug, I've noticed it's actually being deprecated and removed there, basically on the rejection reported here: https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2008Nov/0403.html\r\n\r\nI wonder if the correct solution is to not spec the search event. So my work here is stalled for now until further decision.",
